      "name": "veedstudio/open-edit",
      "type": "repo",
      "brief": "Stars up 14.7% and forks up 17.9% on the same day, from a base of 141 and 8 \u2014 small enough that a handful of people move the percentages, so read the direction rather than the size. What makes it worth a line is the pitch: a video editor you own instead of rent, driven by a coding agent. That is two trends arriving at once, and it is day one on this list.",
