    },
    {
      "name": "garagehq/nightcrawler",
      "type": "repo",
      "brief": "Forks jumped 32.7% against 23.3% star growth in a day, and watchers rose 25% \u2014 three ratios moving together, which is rarer and harder to fake than any one of them spiking. 44 forks on 593 stars is a 7% ratio on a repo this small, meaning the people finding it are running it rather than filing it. A local AI red-teamer that works on a phone is a specific enough claim to attract either real users or real scepticism, and the 34 comments against 118 HackerNews points suggest more of the first.",
      "sources": [
